{
  "name": "functional-safety-engineering",
  "description": "End-to-end functional safety engineering practice for a vehicle or robot function: item definition, HARA with ASIL, safety goals and safe states, requirements with traceability, FMEA, fault tree, dependent failures, SOTIF, independent emergency stop chain, watchdogs and heartbeats per stack, fault injection and a GSN safety case with evidence audit. Engineering method only, no certification claims.",
  "steps": [
    {
